# AFTERFRAME: THE LAST LOOP — PHASE 7
## Vertical Slice Integration: Opening → Calibration → HELIX-04 → Victory/Defeat → Replay

Continue working in the existing AFTERFRAME: THE LAST LOOP React + Three.js project. This is a vertical-slice integration phase, not a rewrite or a new prototype.

The goal is to turn the existing systems into one coherent, playable, polished experience that a new player can start, learn, complete, fail, and replay without relying on developer-only shortcuts.

## 1. Verified baseline and constraints

The Phase 6.2.1 report claims:

- 71/71 simulation tests passing.
- TypeScript validation and production build passing.
- Standard Test Bay and HELIX-04 boss encounter modes functioning.
- Echo recording/playback, Echo-only pressure plates, Resonance Receiver, progression barriers, Relay, Resonance and Convergence functioning.
